# Launch readiness PDF naming

Every launch readiness PDF must have its **creation time (Eastern)** in the file name, so Roger can tell builds apart after `git pull origin main`:

`docs/LAUNCH-READINESS-JAX-BETA-2026-10 YYYYMMDDHHMM.pdf` (example: `LAUNCH-READINESS-JAX-BETA-2026-10 202610032138.pdf`)

- Build with `docs/build-launch-pdf.py`; it stamps the name and the page footer automatically. Never write an undated `LAUNCH-READINESS-*.pdf`.
- Keep earlier timestamped PDFs; do not overwrite them.
- When telling Roger where the PDF is, give the full timestamped file name.
